      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Opioidphobia is one of the major issues in cancer pain management, opioidphobia could limit the efficacy of the treatment process. This paper shows short summary of the findings of a simple study that aimed to discuss the issue of opioidphobia in cancer pain management. Findings showed that there are two kinds; provider's obioidphobia and patient's obioidphobia."},
